<h1>Sounds Of</h1>
<p class="standfirst">A travelling live-music video series documenting emerging Australian artists.</p>

{% video { youtube: "", title: "Sounds Of: latest episode", caption: "Latest episode: [Artist name], recorded in [Town], [State]." } %}

<h2>About the series</h2>
<!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
<div class="ph">
  <p>Sounds Of takes a portable recording rig on the road to film emerging Australian artists playing live in the places that shaped them: lounge rooms, community halls, beaches and back sheds. Every song is a single take, recorded and mixed on location, followed by a short conversation about where it came from.</p>
  <p>I produce, film, record and mix each episode, and look after the series' YouTube and social channels.</p>
</div>

