<h2>How it's made</h2>
<!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
<div class="ph">
  <p>Everything fits in one car: two cameras, a handful of microphones, a portable recorder and a laptop. Songs are captured as multitracks on location, then mixed back home with the sound of the room kept front and centre.</p>
